{"text": "\"Government just means being in charge,\" said Papa, \"like a kind, good king.", "start": 181.26, "end": 185.98, "words": [{"text": "\"Government", "start": 181.26, "end": 181.66}, {"text": "just", "start": 181.66, "end": 182.02}, {"text": "means", "start": 182.02, "end": 182.36}, {"text": "being", "start": 182.36, "end": 182.72}, {"text": "in", "start": 182.72, "end": 182.94}, {"text": "charge,\"", "start": 182.94, "end": 183.26}, {"text": "said", "start": 183.78, "end": 183.88}, {"text": "Papa,", "start": 183.88, "end": 184.18}, {"text": "\"like", "start": 184.56, "end": 184.7}, {"text": "a", "start": 184.7, "end": 184.86}, {"text": "kind,", "start": 184.86, "end": 185.2}, {"text": "good", "start": 185.2, "end": 185.6}, {"text": "king.", "start": 185.6, "end": 185.98}]},
{"text": "And look at all His names.", "start": 186.38, "end": 187.34, "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 186.38, "end": 186.5}, {"text": "look", "start": 186.5, "end": 186.64}, {"text": "at", "start": 186.64, "end": 186.76}, {"text": "all", "start": 186.76, "end": 186.9}, {"text": "His", "start": 186.9, "end": 187.04}, {"text": "names.", "start": 187.04, "end": 187.34}]},
{"text": "Wonderful Counselor means He gives the very best help.", "start": 187.86, "end": 191.2, "words": [{"text": "Wonderful", "start": 187.86, "end": 188.22}, {"text": "Counselor", "start": 188.22, "end": 188.84}, {"text": "means", "start": 188.84, "end": 189.26}, {"text": "He", "start": 189.26, "end": 189.52}, {"text": "gives", "start": 189.52, "end": 189.76}, {"text": "the", "start": 189.76, "end": 189.96}, {"text": "very", "start": 189.96, "end": 190.36}, {"text": "best", "start": 190.36, "end": 190.8}, {"text": "help.", "start": 190.8, "end": 191.2}]},
{"text": "Prince of Peace means He brings peace to our hearts.\"", "start": 191.52, "end": 194.24, "words": [{"text": "Prince", "start": 191.52, "end": 191.72}, {"text": "of", "start": 191.72, "end": 191.92}, {"text": "Peace", "start": 191.92, "end": 192.22}, {"text": "means", "start": 192.22, "end": 192.62}, {"text": "He", "start": 192.62, "end": 192.86}, {"text": "brings", "start": 192.86, "end": 193.08}, {"text": "peace", "start": 193.08, "end": 193.46}, {"text": "to", "start": 193.46, "end": 193.7}, {"text": "our", "start": 193.7, "end": 193.88}, {"text": "hearts.\"", "start": 193.88, "end": 194.24}]},
{"text": "Ema yawned.", "start": 194.76, "end": 195.66, "words": [{"text": "Ema", "start": 194.76, "end": 195.02}, {"text": "yawned.", "start": 195.02, "end": 195.66}]},
{"text": "\"I like Prince of Peace.\"", "start": 196.1, "end": 197.4, "words": [{"text": "\"I", "start": 196.1, "end": 196.32}, {"text": "like", "start": 196.32, "end": 196.54}, {"text": "Prince", "start": 196.54, "end": 196.82}, {"text": "of", "start": 196.82, "end": 197.06}, {"text": "Peace.\"", "start": 197.06, "end": 197.4}]},
{"text": "Which name do you like best, little one?", "start": 198.16, "end": 199.94, "words": [{"text": "Which", "start": 198.16, "end": 198.38}, {"text": "name", "start": 198.38, "end": 198.62}, {"text": "do", "start": 198.62, "end": 198.78}, {"text": "you", "start": 198.78, "end": 198.94}, {"text": "like", "start": 198.94, "end": 199.16}, {"text": "best,", "start": 199.16, "end": 199.46}, {"text": "little", "start": 199.58, "end": 199.72}, {"text": "one?", "start": 199.72, "end": 199.94}]},
{"text": "That's a lovely one.", "start": 203.34, "end": 204.7, "words": [{"text": "That's", "start": 203.34, "end": 203.88}, {"text": "a", "start": 203.88, "end": 204.0}, {"text": "lovely", "start": 204.0, "end": 204.36}, {"text": "one.", "start": 204.36, "end": 204.7}]},
